@page
@model OverviewModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Overview";
}
<h1>Overview</h1>
<p>You're signed in as @Model.Name, Discord ID @Model.UserId, with the @Model.Role role.</p>
<p>Review armor submissions under <a href="/admin/armor">Armor</a>: approve, reject or take them down, with the rules the bot needs checked first. The bot's status and servers arrive in later updates.</p>
<p>Keep the list of players to ban under <a href="/admin/blacklist">Blacklist</a>: add, change or remove entries. Nothing enforces it yet, so entries are kept for when the game's API can.</p>
<p>See every change made on the dashboard, every sign-in and sign-out, and the changes and sign-ins it refused, in the <a href="/admin/audit">Audit log</a>.</p>
